(4) Reliance upon recorded plat. A developer/subdivider may rely upon the provisions set forth in any plat approved and recorded pursuant to this ordinance to the extent that any such conditions constitute vested rights pursuant to Georgia law.
(Ord. of 9-24-01, § 2-4; Res. of 5-13-02; Ord. of 3-19-07)

